#: ../../source/index.rst:4
msgid "欢迎阅读 OpenFoD 项目文档。OpenFoD 是开源重铸的《傲世三国》（Fate of the Dragon）：用现代引擎把城内内政、武将招揽与三层战事重新做可玩、可改、可传。"
msgstr "Welcome to the OpenFoD docs. OpenFoD is an open-source recast of Fate of the Dragon (傲世三国): city governance, officer recruitment, and three combat layers rebuilt for modern engines so the game can be played, forked, and passed on."





#: ../../source/index.rst:6
msgid "本站分成两部分：面向玩家的 **用户使用文档**，以及面向贡献者的 **开发者文档**。编译产物会发布到 `https://www.openfod.org/docs/`。"
msgstr "This site has two halves: a **user guide** for players, and a **developer guide** for contributors. The compiled site is published at `https://www.openfod.org/docs/`."





#: ../../source/index.rst:12
msgid "项目概览"
msgstr "Overview"





#: ../../source/index.rst:16
msgid "OpenFoD 是什么、和 2001 年原作的关系，以及当前仓库怎么分工。"
msgstr "What OpenFoD is, how it relates to the 2001 original, and how the repositories are split."





#: ../../source/index.rst:18
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quickstart"





#: ../../source/index.rst:22
msgid "玩家如何取得可运行构建，开发者如何在本地拉起 Godot 客户端。"
msgstr "How players get a runnable build, and how developers launch the Godot client locally."





#: ../../source/index.rst:28
msgid "安装、城内内政、野外作战、武将招揽，以及魏蜀吴三条开局。"
msgstr "Install, city governance, field battles, officers, and the Wei / Shu / Wu campaigns."





#: ../../source/index.rst:34
msgid "引擎分层、工程门禁、parity 对照，以及文档站如何自动发布到官网。"
msgstr "Engine layers, engineering gates, the parity oracle, and how docs publish to the website."





#: ../../source/index.rst:38
msgid "原作商业数据不会随 OpenFoD 分发。拥有正版《傲世三国》/ Fate of the Dragon 资源的开发者，可以用环境变量指向本地安装，供格式解码与对照测试使用。"
msgstr "Original commercial data does not ship with OpenFoD. Developers who own a legitimate Fate of the Dragon install can point environment variables at it for format decoders and parity tests."





